WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.400
[Street view of the front of a building with a walled front yard. There is a gate.]

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:12.000
[A woman dressed in dark clothing with a cape and headcovering walks up the street and tries to enter one gate.]

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.900
[The woman goes to a second entrance where the gate is open and goes into the building.]

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.200
[The interior of the front yard is shown. There are walls covered with vines and a tree.]

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:28.900
[A woman is shown crossing the yard and checking on something that is steaming on the ground.]

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.100
[The interior has people seated and standing. There are men in uniform and women in suits and skirts.]

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.400
[There is an American flag on the wall. The wall is covered with masks of faces.]

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:50.300
[Closer view of one of the men in uniform and a woman who is watching him light a cigarette.]

00:00:50.300 --> 00:01:01.800
[The man takes off a prosthetic chin and mouth. It fastens onto his face with strings that go around his ears.]

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:16.800
[The man replaces the prosthetic and turns to face and speak to the woman, and she to him.]

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:22.300
[A woman paints a prosthetic chin.]

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:34.700
[The prosthetic chin is fitted to a plaster mask to check for fit.]

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:43.800
[The prosthetic chin covers a severe deformity of the face.]

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:55.800
[A man wearing a white coat works on a plaster mask. A woman assists him.]

00:01:55.800 --> 00:02:03.200
[The man trims some pieces of a mold taken from a mask. He is talking as he brushes the edges.]

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:23.000
[The man hands the pieces to a woman who is piecing them together. She holds the assembled mold up to the camera.]

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:30.400
[The man holds up the plaster mask and then takes off the prosthetic piece which is covering a damaged chin.]

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:43.300
[The man carefully looks at the mask and is talking as he holds it up.]

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:51.700
[He shows the mask with the damaged portion once again hidden by the prosthetic.]

00:02:51.700 --> 00:03:06.400
[A woman shows a mold for a prosthetic ear which is attached to a frame with wire. She uses the frame to hold the ear suspended within a bowl.]

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:19.400
[She turns some knobs on a small machine nearby and closes the top of the machine.]

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:43.400
[Another woman is molding a prosthetic nose.]

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:59.400
[A woman is painting a prosthetic nose that a man is wearing. He is seated in front of her and is in uniform.]

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:14.900
[The man and woman are talking as she works. The plaster molds are hanging on the wall behind them.]

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:27.700
[Two women and a man are discussing and working on a mold. The man removes the prosthetic from the mold to adjust it.]

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:37.600
[The man adjusts the piece and tries it on the plaster mask again.]

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:50.600
[They seem happy with the fit.]

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:57.700
[A man with severe injuries to his face removes a covering he wears over the injury to his face.]

00:04:57.700 --> 00:05:04.300
[He is fitted with a prosthetic piece that covers the area around his eyes and his nose.]

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:10.200
[The prosthetic maker adjusts the fit of the prosthetic which attaches around the man's ears.]

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:32.600
[He removes the prosthetic again to make further fitting adjustments, then replaces it.]

00:05:32.600 --> 00:06:09.300
[End of movie]

